WEBVTT

00:07:57.298 --> 00:08:01.220
hodil po sobi, polni atletov

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.801
in moških vseh vrst.

00:08:03.801 --> 00:08:05.704
In govoril je o pomembnosti

00:08:05.704 --> 00:08:07.063
treniranja fantov v moške

00:08:07.063 --> 00:08:09.101
in spreminjanja "kulture preoblačilnice"

00:08:09.101 --> 00:08:12.370
in o dajanju moškim orodij
za zdrava razmerja.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.298
Nenadoma je pogledal v zadnji del sobe

00:08:15.298 --> 00:08:17.010
in videl svojo hčer.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:19.572
Poklical jo je po imenu, Michaela,

00:08:19.572 --> 00:08:21.431
in rekel: "Michaela, pridi sem."

00:08:21.431 --> 00:08:23.638
Imela je devet let, 
malo je bila sramežljiva,

00:08:23.638 --> 00:08:24.999
a prišla je gor.

00:08:24.999 --> 00:08:27.605
Rekel je: "Sedi zraven mene."

00:08:27.605 --> 00:08:29.728
Usedla se je poleg njega.

00:08:29.728 --> 00:08:32.536
Objel jo je in rekel: